 "description": "Retrieve or export central-bank policy rates in percent. provider=boe series=bank_rate since 1975; boc default overnight_target/bank_rate since 2010; ecb deposit_facility/main_refinancing/marginal_lending and historical main_refinancing_minimum_bid since 1999; fed eight series from directory with distinct starts since 1982. Latest numeric observation by default, optional year or exact date (mutually exclusive). format=csv provides a ready-to-import table with notes and provenance. No date filling, inferred announcement dates or retail quotes. Historical instruments are not current rates. Original source data free; not independently verified.",
